  "name": "Eclipse Walker",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/VeiledMoon_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You have taking on the form of a spirit.</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>Soul</strong> increases by <strong>+2</strong></p></li><li><p>Any attacks you make gain the <strong>Magical</strong> and <strong>Penetrating </strong>traits</p></li><li><p>You take half <strong>Damage</strong> from non-magical attacks</p></li><li><p>You can move through hostile creature's spaces in combat without needing to make a <strong>Dexterity</strong> check</p></li><li><p>Once per turn, when you would be affected by a spell or magical effect, you can negate the effect as a <strong>Free Action</strong></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans',sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-dcd12564-7fff-bcb5-c45b-7173bd86e5d6\">This effect lasts until the end of combat, you become </strong><strong>Incapacitated</strong>, or you are <strong>Dying</strong>. After you use this ability, you cannot use any ability with the <strong>Apex</strong> trait until you complete a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</span></p>",
